@startgantt
' Source (synthetic brief): Lease renewed 2 Mar 2026. Shelving ordered 9 Mar, fitted
' 20 Mar to 10 Apr. Stock moved back 13 to 17 Apr. Staff training 20 to 24 Apr.
' Reopening day 1 May. Fire inspection and signage install happen "before reopening"
' with no date given.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
ganttDiagram {
  task { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD; LineColor #555555 }
  milestone { BackgroundColor #555555 }
}
</style>
printscale weekly
' house-preamble-end

title Shop refit and reopening, spring 2026 (dated timeline)
Project starts 2026-03-02
printscale weekly with calendar date
[Lease renewed] happens 2026-03-02
[Shelving ordered] happens 2026-03-09
[Shelving fitted] starts 2026-03-20 and ends 2026-04-10
[Stock moved back] starts 2026-04-13 and ends 2026-04-17
[Staff training] starts 2026-04-20 and ends 2026-04-24
[Reopening day] happens 2026-05-01
note bottom
  Before reopening, no date in source:
  fire inspection, signage install
end note

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | bar | dated work, start and end stated |
  | diamond | dated milestone |
  | note | step with no date in source |
endlegend
@endgantt
